FLICO (FLiCo) — COMPANY KNOWLEDGE BASE
========================================

## About FLiCo

FLiCo is powered by the visionary strength of Future Life Investment Limited. FLiCo seeks to redefine the consumer electronics landscape in Sri Lanka by offering products that complement your lifestyle. From state-of-the-art home electronics and stylish kitchenware to luxurious furniture, FLiCo's range is designed to elevate every aspect of home life. FLiCo also caters to the industrial sector with cutting-edge electronic solutions, seamlessly blending innovation with elegance.

FLiCo is dedicated to setting new standards in premium living through exquisite design and lasting performance.

Website: https://flico.lk

### Vision
To be the gold standard in consumer electronics and appliances, delivering exceptional experiences through a fusion of state-of-the-art technology and enduring reliability.

### Mission
To offer top-tier consumer electronics and appliances that integrate the latest technological innovations with robust reliability. FLiCo strives to offer products that continuously deliver superior and transformative experiences.

### Purpose
To transform everyday experiences with innovative technology by offering high-performance products that provide lasting value.

### Brands Carried
FLiCo brings celebrated brands to Sri Lanka, including:
- KONKA (primary brand — home appliances and electronics)
- Riko
- Pigeon
- Samsung
- LG
- Sony

All products are offered at attractive prices with exceptional after-sales support.

### Board of Directors
- Danushka Udugama — CEO
- Sanjaya Jayaweera — COO
- Kasun Perera — CAO / CMO

