## Refrigerators & Freezers

All prices are in Sri Lankan Rupees (LKR) and include standard warranty. Delivery available island-wide. Installation support provided in the Western Province free of charge.

### KONKA Single Door Refrigerators

1. **KONKA 92L Single Door Mini Fridge (KRF-92S)** — LKR 49,900
   Compact single-door refrigerator ideal for bedrooms, dorms, and small offices. 92L total capacity with a small chiller compartment. Manual defrost, R600a eco-friendly refrigerant, reversible door, and adjustable thermostat. Energy-efficient and whisper-quiet.

2. **KONKA 130L Single Door Refrigerator (KRF-130S)** — LKR 64,500
   A practical single-door fridge for small families or couples. 130L capacity with separate ice-box, adjustable tempered glass shelves, and a vegetable crisper. Low power consumption and stable cooling performance even during voltage fluctuations.

3. **KONKA 180L Single Door Defrost Refrigerator (KRF-180SD)** — LKR 79,900
   Mid-size 180L single-door fridge with manual defrost. Features a large freezer compartment, adjustable shelves, an egg tray, and a bottle rack. Ideal for everyday Sri Lankan households.

4. **KONKA 220L Single Door Refrigerator (KRF-220S)** — LKR 94,500
   Roomy 220L single-door model with separate freezer section, anti-bacterial gasket, and toughened glass shelves. Rust-resistant body finish suitable for humid climates.

### KONKA Double Door Refrigerators (No-Frost)

5. **KONKA 240L Double Door No-Frost (KRD-240NF)** — LKR 119,900
   Entry-level no-frost double-door refrigerator. 240L total (180L fridge + 60L freezer). Multi-airflow cooling, LED interior light, and frost-free operation eliminate the need for manual defrosting.

6. **KONKA 280L Double Door No-Frost (KRD-280NF)** — LKR 139,500
   280L total capacity with separate temperature controls for fridge and freezer. Toughened glass shelves, humidity-controlled vegetable drawer, and energy-saving inverter compressor.

7. **KONKA 350L Double Door Inverter Refrigerator (KRD-350INV)** — LKR 179,900
   Mid-range 350L inverter refrigerator with dual cooling system, digital display, and a 10-year compressor warranty. Smooth, silent operation with 35% lower energy consumption than non-inverter models.

8. **KONKA 410L Double Door Inverter Refrigerator (KRD-410INV)** — LKR 214,500
   Family-size 410L inverter fridge with multi-airflow technology, deodorizer filter, and large crisper drawers. Stainless-steel finish and recessed handles.

9. **KONKA 450L Double Door Inverter Refrigerator (KRD-450INV)** — LKR 249,900
   Premium 450L double-door inverter model with twin cooling, fast-freeze mode, and a water dispenser. Perfect for larger households.

### KONKA Side-by-Side & French Door Refrigerators

10. **KONKA 520L Side-by-Side Refrigerator (KSBS-520)** — LKR 319,900
    Spacious 520L side-by-side fridge-freezer with a non-plumbed water and ice dispenser, LED touch controls, and multi-zone cooling. Premium silver finish.

11. **KONKA 580L Side-by-Side Inverter Refrigerator (KSBS-580INV)** — LKR 374,500
    Flagship 580L side-by-side inverter model with smart cooling, fingerprint-resistant stainless steel doors, and a digital temperature display.

12. **KONKA 605L French Door Refrigerator (KFD-605)** — LKR 449,900
    Luxury 605L French-door refrigerator with bottom freezer drawer, dual evaporators, and an in-built water dispenser. Sleek matte-black finish.

### Samsung Refrigerators

13. **Samsung 253L Double Door Digital Inverter (RT28)** — LKR 169,900
    Samsung's popular 253L double-door fridge with Digital Inverter compressor and 20-year warranty on the compressor. Convertible 5-in-1 mode lets you switch the freezer compartment to a fridge.

14. **Samsung 322L Double Door Twin Cooling Plus (RT34)** — LKR 219,500
    322L double-door fridge with Twin Cooling Plus for fresher food longer, digital inverter, and a Power Cool button for rapid cooling.

15. **Samsung 700L Side-by-Side SpaceMax (RS72)** — LKR 489,000
    Premium 700L side-by-side refrigerator with SpaceMax thin-wall insulation, non-plumbed water dispenser, and digital inverter technology.

### LG Refrigerators

16. **LG 260L Smart Inverter Double Door (GL-B281)** — LKR 174,900
    260L double-door LG fridge with Smart Inverter Compressor, Door Cooling+, and moist-balance crisper. 10-year compressor warranty.

17. **LG 437L Smart Inverter Double Door (GL-T432)** — LKR 264,500
    437L LG double-door inverter fridge with multi-air flow, auto smart connect (works during power cuts with an inverter/solar setup), and a hygiene fresh filter.

### Chest Freezers (KONKA)

18. **KONKA Chest Freezer 202L (KF-202W2)** — LKR 109,900
    202L commercial-grade chest freezer with adjustable thermostat (-12°C to -24°C), recessed handle, key lock, and an interior LED light. Suitable for home or small shops.

19. **KONKA Chest Freezer 300L (KF-300W)** — LKR 144,500
    Larger 300L chest freezer with fast-freeze function, removable storage basket, and a hinged lid with counterweight. Energy-efficient compressor designed for tropical climates.

### Deefrost (Budget) Refrigerators

20. **Deefrost 196L Double Door Refrigerator** — LKR 84,900
    Budget-friendly 196L double-door fridge from Deefrost. Direct-cool operation, toughened glass shelves, and a separate top freezer. Excellent value for small families.

21. **Deefrost 201L Double Door Refrigerator** — LKR 89,500
    201L Deefrost double-door fridge with manual defrost, a large vegetable crisper, and stable cooling. Backed by FLiCo's after-sales service network.

**Note on availability:** Stock and exact pricing can vary. For the latest prices, promotions, and stock, please call the Pelawatte showroom on +94 11 2 866 676 or the Maharagama showroom on +94 11 2 843 443, or visit flico.lk.

